<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">October 29, 2024</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">National Stock Exchange of India Ltd. (Stock Code:
DRREDDY-EQ)</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">BSE Limited (Stock Code: 500124)</P>

